  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&apos;s contribution to the Convention Against Torture Initiative (CTI) 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategic objective of the CTI project is to achieve enhanced ratification and implementation of the Convention against Torture by 2030. The immediate objectives are: 1) identify challenges and barriers to ratification and implementation of the UNCAT in developing countries and 2) address and mitigate these obstacles through inter-state capacity building, technical assistance and dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
